{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "57cc4b0f-45c1-8b37-a1f7-a56c3af010e4",
  "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:50:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Josephine Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:48:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:48:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hello, yes, sure. I know it's Sunday and City Hall is closed, so I'm calling the storm line like the recording said. Is that all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:49:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, that's what it's for. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:49:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the low spot at the end of my block is under water, about a foot, I'd say. It's from the nor'easter that ended yesterday. And it's every time, you know. Every single storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:49:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And where are you, Mrs.…?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:49:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Conti, Josephine Conti. Of course. I'm at 419 Washington Street, in the Point. The water's at the end of the block there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:49:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "419 Washington Street, the low spot at the end of the block, about a foot deep. Is traffic getting through?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:49:39-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, but slow, wicked slow. Cars are crawling through it, one at a time. Somebody's going to stall out. Who do I call to get it checked? Because I've been told to call before, and nothing changes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:49:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You called the right place. I'll put this in for a crew to look at the drainage there today. Do you want a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:50:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. It's 401-555-0186. I'm home, I have to leave around noon next week for the weekend thing, I trade baseball cards at a shop on weekends. But I'm here now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:50:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0186. I'll pass it along, Mrs. Conti."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:50:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, thank you, of course."
    }
  ],
